00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:43.490
Thank you for saving our Planet Hydo.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:49.380
Since the day Metarex came, we had to hide underground.

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:54.460
But we're now free! There's nothing better than this!

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.930
We want to hold a festival in your honor!

00:02:00.090 --> 00:02:01.720
Fantastic!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.430
Hooray! We get to eat great food!

00:02:04.430 --> 00:02:05.890
I can't wait.

00:02:06.390 --> 00:02:08.060
I wonder what kind of festival it will be?

00:02:08.310 --> 00:02:09.560
Oh yeah!

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:18.010
Episode 56

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:18.010
Dr. Eggman Enters!

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.870
Oh yeah!

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:25.290
Oh yeah!

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:28.710
This is incredible.

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.830
Oh yeah!

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:37.340
Oh yeah!

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:39.260
Next!

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:44.640
Oh yeah!

00:02:46.810 --> 00:02:48.180
What?

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:51.810
Wait a sec!

00:02:52.150 --> 00:02:53.560
What's going on?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:03:03.240
Are you having fun? This is how we show our happiness! It's the “Heave-Ho Festival!”

00:03:04.070 --> 00:03:06.620
This is great!

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.910
This is an interesting custom.

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.460
This isn't the time to admire it!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:15.880
My butt hurts!

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:18.880
What a happy day!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:19.920
Oh yeah!

00:03:21.760 --> 00:03:23.090
Everyone!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.260
Please look at this!

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:27.390
The Chaos Emerald.

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:29.640
You found it?

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.520
Yeah.

00:03:31.890 --> 00:03:33.770
What's with the racket?

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:36.110
It looks fun.

00:03:37.190 --> 00:03:38.780
That looks like fun?

00:03:38.780 --> 00:03:41.360
Why are you doing that?

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:45.070
Since we defeated the enemy and retrieved the Planet Egg...

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:47.280
They're thanking us.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:50.040
I'm glad they're entertaining us, but...

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.750
I've had enough!

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.920
How lively!

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:55.920
There are still six left.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:59.760
It's good that we found the first one.

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:03.880
I don't know what you're talking about, but that's cause for celebration!

00:04:03.880 --> 00:04:05.590
Oh yeah!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:07.970
Oh yeah!

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.680
Do you want to join us?

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:13.690
No thanks.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:28.490
It's my chance. My patience will be rewarded.

00:04:28.490 --> 00:04:29.620
All right...

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:33.710
How will I get the Chaos Emerald this time?

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:40.460
“This time?” He makes it sound like he's succeeded every time.

00:04:40.460 --> 00:04:43.130
He fails most of the time.

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:44.590
Seriously.

00:04:45.220 --> 00:04:48.470
Then I want to hear your ideas.

00:04:49.430 --> 00:04:50.810
You heard us?

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:52.980
He has good hearing.

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.310
If your ideas are worse than mine...

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:01.030
I suddenly have a headache!

00:05:01.030 --> 00:05:02.070
Same here!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.450
Even robots get headaches!

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:06.280
It hurts!

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:08.490
I see. You have headaches.

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:10.780
Then I have to fix you.

00:05:13.620 --> 00:05:15.040
Help me!

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.290
Freeze!

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:20.630
I'll be next! I have to escape!

00:05:24.260 --> 00:05:26.590
I want no part of that!

00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.390
You're...

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:34.430
Will you do me a favor, kid?

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:38.310
Why do I have to do you a favor?

00:05:38.730 --> 00:05:40.650
I'm going to tell Eggman!

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:41.650
Now now...

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:46.110
Are you sure you want to do that? You may get in trouble later.

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:48.360
Why would I get in trouble?

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:50.280
This.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:52.450
Does it look familiar?

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.620
That's...

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.710
That's mine!

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:01.630
I looked at the picture inside. You're...

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:07.630
Stop! Please don't say anything!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:09.720
I'll do anything you want!

00:06:09.720 --> 00:06:11.510
Please!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:14.220
Good boy.

00:06:15.850 --> 00:06:17.100
Ribbit.

00:06:18.480 --> 00:06:19.940
Stop!

00:06:19.940 --> 00:06:21.310
Help!

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:22.730
Give up!

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:24.440
They're still at it.

00:06:24.440 --> 00:06:25.730
Dr. Eggman!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:27.740
What is it?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:29.910
What do you think of this plan?

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:31.660
Well...

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:32.910
What is it?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:33.780
Do this...

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:35.540
And do that!

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:41.000
I see. You're on your toes for a change.

00:06:41.420 --> 00:06:42.880
I'm always on my toes!

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:45.920
I expect nothing less from a robot that I created!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.300
We're saved!

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.130
Thank goodness for the messenger robot!

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:50.300
Thanks for the compliment.

00:06:50.380 --> 00:06:51.720
Anyway...

00:06:57.890 --> 00:07:01.650
Even if it's a festival, I won't let anyone do that to me!

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:04.230
That's...

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:08.570
Eggman!

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:12.490
Knuckles! Why are you here?

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:15.580
I finally found help!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.870
Did something happen to you?

00:07:18.080 --> 00:07:23.460
I was traveling around in my spaceship when I encountered engine trouble and ended up on this planet.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.880
I found that I ran out of fuel.

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.380
I don't know what to do anymore!

00:07:29.380 --> 00:07:32.140
How pathetic!

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:34.470
I'm being punished for my sins.

00:07:34.470 --> 00:07:37.560
Calm down. Don't get depressed.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:42.150
I was always doing horrible things.

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:45.400
It's my fault for getting carried away.

00:07:45.980 --> 00:07:50.150
But I don't want to spend the rest of my life on a remote planet.

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:52.030
I'll make a promise!

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:55.410
If I can get out of here, I'll never do anything evil ever again!

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:59.660
If only I had a Chaos Emerald!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.630
I could use its energy to power my ship!

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:16.970
What?

00:08:17.430 --> 00:08:20.390
Let Eggman borrow the Chaos Emerald?

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:24.900
Eggman swore that he won't do anything evil for the rest of his life.

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.240
Not again, Knuckles.

00:08:29.240 --> 00:08:31.360
You're too kind.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:35.410
Eggman is lying again!

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:39.410
Anyway, my butt hurts!

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:43.920
I should never have discussed this with you!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.380
I found this in the first place.

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:48.960
I'll do whatever I want with it!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:53.840
Hold it, Knuckles.

00:08:53.840 --> 00:08:56.100
You won't be able to change my mind!

00:08:56.260 --> 00:08:58.560
You want to fight instead?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:00.430
You give me no choice!

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.940
Sonic! Knuckles!

00:09:06.310 --> 00:09:06.900
Here I go!

00:09:06.900 --> 00:09:07.690
Come on!

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:11.900
Why?

00:09:37.290 --> 00:09:39.670
This is bad. We have to stop them!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:40.760
Everybody!

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.720
My butt hurts. Is it bruised?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.760
It seems fine.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:49.470
We have to inspect the X-Tornado.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:50.520
You're right.

00:09:50.680 --> 00:09:54.020
Everybody, why aren't you stopping them?

00:09:54.810 --> 00:09:57.270
Those two will be fine.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.020
This always happens.

00:10:00.070 --> 00:10:02.860
Let them go at it until they're satisfied.

00:10:02.860 --> 00:10:04.450
It'll be fine.

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:08.200
What's wrong with them?

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:16.500
I have to stop them!

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:18.920
Please stop!

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:23.090
Stop! Please stop!

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:26.760
Cosmo, you shouldn't get too close.

00:10:35.770 --> 00:10:39.440
Now's my chance to steal the Chaos Emerald.

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:43.740
I can't believe it worked out so well!

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.740
Dr. Eggman!

00:10:46.110 --> 00:10:48.530
I came because I was worried about you!

00:10:48.530 --> 00:10:49.830
Hey!

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:51.990
Be quiet!

00:10:51.990 --> 00:10:55.500
You didn't have to come! Go away!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:58.710
How rude! After I went through the trouble of coming here!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:02.170
Sheesh, can't you grasp the situation?

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:03.300
Dr. Eggman!

00:11:05.170 --> 00:11:08.930
I brought you lunch! I forgot to give it to you!

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.800
Keep your voice down!

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.930
I'm sorry...

00:11:13.680 --> 00:11:15.430
Go home and stay still.

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:16.890
Okay!

00:11:16.890 --> 00:11:19.520
Don't come back!

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:25.990
Well done, kid.

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.240
He should mind its own business!

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:33.200
What would've happened if they found me?

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.370
I knew you were up to no good.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:39.750
Hello!

00:11:46.050 --> 00:11:48.340
How's everyone?

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:49.550
Why you!

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:56.180
Look! It was Eggman's plan all along!

00:11:58.730 --> 00:11:59.690
Eggman!

00:12:00.060 --> 00:12:01.610
What are you doing here?

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.360
Well...

00:12:04.980 --> 00:12:07.570
I was picking bananas because it's a nice day.

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:12.070
I don't see a banana field anywhere!

00:12:12.070 --> 00:12:13.330
You're lying!

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:19.670
You were going to steal the Chaos Emerald while Sonic and Knuckles were fighting!

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:22.000
What?

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:22.960
Is that true?

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.460
No! It's a misunderstanding!

00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:27.380
There's no misunderstanding!

00:12:27.920 --> 00:12:29.840
How dare you!

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:30.800
Don't do it!

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.100
You need to go on a diet.

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:36.970
You saved my life, Knuckles.

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.690
Why are you interfering?

00:12:39.690 --> 00:12:42.850
Don't you understand that he's tricking you again?

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:44.230
Just like before!

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:46.190
Please help me.

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:50.700
You’re sure that we can return home if we have the Chaos Emeralds?

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:53.320
And that other time!

00:12:53.780 --> 00:12:56.830
Let me hold the Chaos Emeralds.

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.200
Thank you, Knuckles!

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:01.460
Same here, Dr. Eggman.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:05.090
I will keep them in a safe place.

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:07.500
Let’s trust him.

00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:11.930
The Eggman Empire will soon be realized!

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:14.590
It was always the same!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:20.480
That's all in the past! Since Eggman has changed, I'm helping him leave this planet!

00:13:20.980 --> 00:13:22.230
Sheesh...

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:25.690
But Eggman is lying!

00:13:27.230 --> 00:13:29.110
How do you know?

00:13:29.940 --> 00:13:32.490
You're stupid for not knowing!

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:33.200
What?

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.530
I'm the one who's fighting you.

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:38.790
Bring it on!

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:42.210
I can't believe this! They're fighting amongst themselves.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:45.290
They don't know anything about the dangers facing the universe!

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.380
Please stop!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:50.300
This isn't the time for unnecessary fighting!

00:13:50.460 --> 00:13:55.090
We have to work together and fight Metarex!

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:56.640
Out of the way, Cosmo!

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.010
Stay back because it's dangerous!

00:14:00.720 --> 00:14:03.980
Was it my mistake to believe in them?

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:06.770
What's going on?

00:14:11.990 --> 00:14:13.120
What is it?

00:14:21.340 --> 00:14:23.710
Dr. Eggman, we're here to rescue you!

00:14:23.710 --> 00:14:25.380
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:14:25.380 --> 00:14:28.340
I didn't ask for your help!

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:33.060
But the messenger robot said that you were in a lot of trouble!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:34.720
Well, maybe...

00:14:34.720 --> 00:14:38.310
It said that they caught you trying to steal the Chaos Emerald!

00:14:38.310 --> 00:14:42.560
I easily tricked Knuckles, but not the others.

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:46.320
How dare you, Eggman!

00:14:48.150 --> 00:14:49.320
You heard me?

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:51.740
I told you so.

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.580
I'll never forgive you!

00:14:53.580 --> 00:14:55.040
Whatever.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.950
I don't care!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:08.010
If you want me to spare her life, hand over the Chaos Emerald!

00:15:08.010 --> 00:15:10.380
You should've done this from the beginning.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.090
That was bad planning.

00:15:15.010 --> 00:15:16.270
Cosmo!

00:15:19.060 --> 00:15:20.310
Cosmo!

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:22.600
This is my chance.

00:15:23.480 --> 00:15:25.070
Let Cosmo go!

00:15:25.070 --> 00:15:26.360
I don't want to.

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:30.820
No villain would say “Sure!” and let her go!

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:32.820
It's mine.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.080
What?

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:39.460
Ribbit.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:42.370
Metarex!

00:15:46.960 --> 00:15:49.170
The Chaos Emerald is mine!

00:15:49.720 --> 00:15:52.550
It screwed up my plans!

00:15:57.260 --> 00:15:58.680
The Chaos Emerald!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:03.270
How dare you! I won't lose to the likes of you!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:06.110
I'll show you the power of a recurring character!

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:09.070
We won't let you steal the spotlight!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:12.910
Are you okay?

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.030
Don't mind me! What about the Chaos Emerald?

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.870
Go!

00:16:26.380 --> 00:16:28.800
What? The drill can't hurt it!

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:30.340
It's perfectly fine.

00:16:30.340 --> 00:16:31.840
What an impressive frog!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.680
It has incredible power!

00:16:40.680 --> 00:16:43.190
Dr. Eggman, it's a powerful enemy.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:46.480
We should let Sonic handle this.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.230
You fool! We're veterans! Show some spirit!

00:16:49.530 --> 00:16:53.700
Those who disturb the order of the universe, listen carefully!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:57.570
You don't know how to use the Chaos Emeralds.

00:16:57.570 --> 00:17:02.960
We, the Metarex, know how to extract the true power of the Chaos Emeralds.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:04.830
Stop acting so arrogant.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:08.090
What do you mean by its true power?

00:17:08.250 --> 00:17:10.090
Its true power is...

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:13.380
What was it again? I forgot.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:14.680
Just slipped my mind!

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.220
What?

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.430
If you don't know, then give it to me!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:25.810
I'll use it to its full potential to build my Eggman Empire!

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.900
Oh no!

00:17:42.830 --> 00:17:45.290
I guess we're not the main characters of this episode!

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.330
Nope.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:50.500
He was all talk.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:55.130
Take this!

00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:12.020
Leave! I can't waste my time with you!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:15.280
I have to get the Planet Egg.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.490
Planet Egg?

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:21.490
No! If it takes the Planet Egg, this planet will die!

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:23.700
We know, but...

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.250
Don't worry!

00:18:25.250 --> 00:18:27.040
Leave it to us!

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.500
Hold it!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.210
You're not getting away!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:37.130
Flying Body Attack!

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:42.600
Damn! How do we defeat it?

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:43.930
Metarex!

00:18:43.930 --> 00:18:45.270
Look at this!

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.930
That's...

00:18:46.930 --> 00:18:48.440
Planet Egg!

00:18:48.810 --> 00:18:52.440
So you had it all along.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:59.410
If you want it, come and get it!

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:02.450
Thanks to you, I didn't have to search for it.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:06.540
How could you do this, Chris?

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.830
Let Chris handle this.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:09.750
But...

00:19:09.750 --> 00:19:11.710
What a stupid thing to do.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:16.300
Really? I think it's a nice idea.

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:24.970
All right! I have its attention!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.640
Come and get me!

00:19:28.390 --> 00:19:31.150
Just a little more...

00:19:31.350 --> 00:19:32.150
Now!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:33.900
Here I go!

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:36.530
Oh yeah!

00:19:37.570 --> 00:19:39.030
The Heave-Ho Festival!

00:19:41.950 --> 00:19:43.030
Go!

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:48.540
Stop!

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:58.090
Connecting energy to the cannon's hammer!

00:19:59.090 --> 00:20:02.430
Pressurizing the cannon rod's ring energy!

00:20:02.430 --> 00:20:04.760
Sonic, start your spin!

00:20:04.760 --> 00:20:06.970
I really have to do it?

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:09.020
Get serious, Sonic!

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:12.270
The Planet Egg and the Chaos Emerald are at stake!

00:20:12.850 --> 00:20:14.520
Fine.

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:15.610
Here I go!

00:20:17.440 --> 00:20:18.780
I won't let you!

00:20:34.750 --> 00:20:36.540
Trigger safety off!

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:39.510
Targeting Metarex straight ahead!

00:20:40.340 --> 00:20:42.760
Fire Sonic Driver!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:50.680
Yes!

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.520
Knuckles!

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.270
Are you all right?

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:58.730
Yeah. The Planet Egg is fine too.

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:02.030
What's going on?

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:04.910
It's an ordinary beach ball.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.280
That means...

00:21:09.280 --> 00:21:10.290
Yes!

00:21:12.580 --> 00:21:15.170
Even you tricked me!

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:19.170
But that's why Metarex couldn't tell that it was all an act.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:22.510
Are you trying to console me?

00:21:22.510 --> 00:21:26.260
No, we're showing you respect, Knuckles.

00:21:27.470 --> 00:21:28.390
But...

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:32.180
I think it's better to be deceived than to deceive.

00:21:32.980 --> 00:21:37.230
Because if you're deceived, you can't hurt anyone.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:40.480
I guess that's true.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:43.440
Actually, it's definitely true!

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:45.360
It sure is!

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:48.200
That's what we like about you.

00:21:48.200 --> 00:21:50.200
Even though I wouldn't have been tricked.

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:52.240
How dare you!

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:59.590
We failed again.

00:21:59.790 --> 00:22:02.590
When will we succeed?

00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:05.510
It's your fault that we failed!

00:22:06.130 --> 00:22:08.590
I was so close to succeeding!

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:11.560
It's the Messenger Robot's fault!

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:14.310
That's right! It's all his fault!

00:22:15.100 --> 00:22:17.940
Where's the Messenger Robot?

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:21.900
Sheesh, it was such a good plan.

00:22:21.900 --> 00:22:23.440
Oh well.

00:22:23.980 --> 00:22:26.450
But you'll serve me again, right?

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:27.700
No way!

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:29.910
Are you sure?

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:33.700
Okay, I'll do it.

00:22:34.330 --> 00:22:36.960
I have to, right?

00:22:38.920 --> 00:22:43.310
Idiot!

